WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:03.627
Keating 4.0 starts by getting to know you.

00:00:04.433 --> 00:00:06.213
Every step is optional.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.273
Chat is one click away.

00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:12.373
Tell it how much to ask before it tells.

00:00:12.613 --> 00:00:14.093
What to do when you're stuck.

00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:16.013
Where its analogies come from.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:24.040
Accessibility choices are requirements: plain language, captions, easier type, less motion.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:30.973
Longer goals become pursuits — close by, while today's question still leads.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.860
Reshape the teacher itself: its persona, its voice, how it speaks.

00:00:38.533 --> 00:00:42.393
Then choose Show me around — on the screen you're actually using.
